to references/ (loaded on demand), so the always-on body budget shrinks.

- rollback: 719 -> 95 body lines. references/methods.md (the 6 method walkthroughs)
  + references/workflow-integration.md (integration, issue status, troubleshooting).
- plan: 588 -> 169 body lines. references/{phase1-design,phase2-research,phase3-setup}.md;
  SKILL.md keeps the entry HARD-GATE, pre-flight checks, and a phase TOC.
- Content is relocated verbatim (no loss); .codex mirror regenerated (inSync).
- Drain the A2 context-cost allowlist to empty (both bodies now <=500; the
  self-tightening "allowlist stays honest" test confirms it).
- dep-guard.plan.test.js now reads the plan skill's combined content (SKILL.md +
  phase references) since the asserted steps moved into references/.

Refs kernel epic 0f3f69f4, issue cd943a15 (Phase A #3). Stacked on #295 (A2).

