+# Select: 5. Rollback entire branch
+# Enter: <start-commit>..<end-commit>
+```
+
+### Merge Conflicts During Rollback
+
+**Cause**: Revert conflicts with subsequent changes
+
+**Solution**:
+```bash
+# 1. Rollback creates conflict markers
+git status
